/// Europe costs 760 coordinates.
///
/// Hand-drawn polygons were tried first and looked hand-drawn: at this size a
/// coastline is the only thing that says "map" rather than "shapes". Real data
/// simplified hard is cheaper than fake data drawn carefully.
///
